If you're looking for more than just a job - if you're looking for a place where you can truly make a difference - you might be the next person to join WIRE IT .
Role: DevOps Engineer - Akamai
Location: Remote, Portugal
Required skills:

• Proven experience operating at a senior level in cloud infrastructure, SRE, or DevOps within a large enterprise environment.

• 2+ years of hands-on, recent experience supporting and configuring Content Delivery Networks, specifically Akamai.

• Strong, hands-on proficiency in managing cloud environments using Terraform or Terragrunt

• Solid coding skills in Python, alongside working knowledge of JavaScript and Shell for building internal automation and tooling.

• Deep understanding of web fundamentals, including DNS, proxies, and edge security technologies (WAF, bot management).

• Experience with Git, modern automation tools, CI/CD pipelines, and general DevOps principles

